# Drug links shared from the app (https://mediglobe.me/drug/<id>) get the landing page drug/index.html.
# 200 = rewrite, not a redirect: the address keeps the id (drug.js reads it) and the iOS/Android
# app links for /drug/* keep matching. The target is /drug/, not /drug/index.html: Pages answers
# any .../index.html with a 308 to .../, which would drop the id and loop (/drug/ matches /drug/*).
# Never add a rule that touches /.well-known/* (apple-app-site-association, assetlinks.json).
/drug/*  /drug/  200
